WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.000
The light goes first,

00:04.000 --> 00:07.500
then the hills follow it down.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Press A to pause. B mutes the sound.

00:12.500 --> 00:17.000
Hold the D-pad left or right to scrub through time.

00:17.500 --> 00:22.000
Up and down light the LEDs for volume.

00:22.500 --> 00:29.500
Press F, or the FULLSCREEN pill, and the console steps away.
